X.append(eq('ls')); X.append(eq('gls'))
X.append(P(f'where Σ_n is the noise covariance. Weighting channels by their noise variance, w_k = 1/(σ_k²(1 + |λ_k|²)), raises the output SNR of the pooled estimator by 0.6 dB on average (up to 2.2 dB), and weighted least squares gains 0.7 dB on average over least squares for HT and 0.9 dB for the STFT and the wavelet. The stability of least-squares reconstruction is governed by the frame symbol'))
X.append(eq('symbol'))
